{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alarm signal has reached your ship. Your partner, Martha, needs your help...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <br><strong>EXPLORE IO, ONE OF JUPITER'S MOONS, IN THIS COZY SCI-FI ADVENTURE </strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/d6c6e354197c732ef778bd64ce977a31.poster.avif?t=1761759737\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/d6c6e354197c732ef778bd64ce977a31.webm?t=1761759737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/d6c6e354197c732ef778bd64ce977a31.mp4?t=1761759737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Io, Jupiter\u2019s third moon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down exploration and puzzle game, you'll play as an astronaut on a mission to find a missing companion while investigating the remnants of an ancient alien civilization.\u00a0Journey through mysterious landscapes, lost cities, lava rivers, and towering mountains as you uncover a vast and unique alien ecosystem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> <br> <br><strong>DISCOVER THE SECRETS OF CIVIH-TAS AND UNRAVEL THE QUANTUM MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/858ed239a70e893557862e5d9c230dcc.poster.avif?t=1761759737\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/858ed239a70e893557862e5d9c230dcc.webm?t=1761759737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/858ed239a70e893557862e5d9c230dcc.mp4?t=1761759737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liquid light? Teleportation? Objects existing in two different states at once?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The incredible alien civilization of Civih-Tas has built a massive settlement on this moon! Investigate its structures and advanced technologies as you continue your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLLOW MARTHA'S TRAIL ALONGSIDE YOUR COMPANION ROBOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/b9977eb1d10c23aa0ad8b21932bf9f50.poster.avif?t=1761759737\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/b9977eb1d10c23aa0ad8b21932bf9f50.webm?t=1761759737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/extras/b9977eb1d10c23aa0ad8b21932bf9f50.mp4?t=1761759737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Uncover what happened to your lost partner by tracking her research across Civih-Tas. Reconstruct her path through the records she left behind\u2014always accompanied by your loyal and quirky robot, ChatCPT.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095460?t=1761759737","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/c9b0f85dac19d82ec1baee09973baab83cc3f1c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761759737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/08103fb95d1c245d9e311acc16bf10b7754175ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761759737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095460/08103fb95d1c245d9e311acc16bf10b